    <string name="home_emergency_wipe">Emergency wipe of this device</string>
    <string name="wipe_title">Erase everything from this phone?</string>
    <string name="wipe_body">If a connection exists the server is asked to end all your sessions (three seconds at most; the wipe does not wait for it). Then erased now, without a connection: your session and its tokens, the upload queue and its progress, file permissions, settings and temporary files. What already reached the server stays there. Your original files in the gallery are not touched.</string>
    <string name="wipe_understand">I understand this cannot be undone</string>
    <string name="wipe_confirm">Erase now</string>
    <string name="wipe_in_progress">Erasing…</string>
    <string name="wipe_cancel">Cancel</string>
    <string name="wipe_done_title">Erased</string>
    <string name="wipe_done_body">Nothing of the app remains on this device except what is listed below as not erased. You can sign in again whenever you want.</string>
    <string name="revoked_title">Your session was revoked</string>
    <string name="revoked_body">The server refused this session (it was ended from another device or by the administration). Every running upload stopped and the tokens and upload state were erased from this device. Sign in again if this device is in your hands.</string>
